<view class="page"><view class="hero"><image class="mascot" src="/assets/study-dragon-mascot.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view>{{date}}</view><view class="headline">{{insight.title}}</view><view class="sub">已完成 {{completed}} / {{total}} 项 · <text class="goal-edit" bindtap="editGoal">目标 {{goalLabel}}学习 · {{goalPickerOpen ? '收起' : '修改'}}</text></view><view class="meter"><view class="meter-fill" style="width:{{progress}}%"></view></view><view class="sub">专注 {{focusMinutes}} 分钟 · {{progress}}% · 连续 {{streak}} 天</view><button class="start" bindtap="goFocus">开始一次专注</button></view><view wx:if="{{goalPickerOpen}}" class="picker-card goal-picker"><view class="picker-title">设定每日目标</view><view class="wheel-shell"><view class="wheel-pointer left-pointer"></view><picker-view class="wheel" value="{{goalPickerValue}}" indicator-style="height: 72rpx; background: transparent" bindchange="goalPickerChange"><picker-view-column><view wx:for="{{goalHourOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="wheel-item">{{item}} 时</view></picker-view-column><picker-view-column><view wx:for="{{goalMinuteOptions}}" wx:key="*this" class="wheel-item">{{item}} 分</view></picker-view-column></picker-view><view class="wheel-pointer right-pointer"></view></view><view class="muted goal-tip">左右小指针对准的一行就是当前目标，滚动即可保存。</view></view><view class="card insight-card"><view class="insight-kicker">今日学习卡 · {{insight.type}}</view><view class="insight-content">{{insight.content}}</view><view class="insight-source">来源 · {{insight.source}}</view></view><view class="card next-step"><view class="next-kicker">现在做什么</view><view class="next-title">{{dailyPlan.action.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{dailyPlan.action.subject}} · 今天还差 {{dailyPlan.remainingMinutes}} 分钟目标；任务预计 {{dailyPlan.plannedMinutes}} 分钟</view><button class="next-button" bindtap="goNext">{{dailyPlan.action.kind==='review'?'去复盘':dailyPlan.action.kind==='empty'?'开始整理':'开始这项专注'}}</button></view><view class="section">今日任务</view><view wx:if="{{pendingTasks.length}}" class="drag-tip">长按任务卡可调整优先级，越靠前越优先</view><block wx:for="{{pendingTasks}}" wx:key="id"><view class="task-wrap"><view class="card task pending-task-card {{draggingTaskId===item.id?'dragging':''}} {{dragTargetId===item.id && draggingTaskId!==item.id?'drag-target':''}}" style="transform:translateY({{draggingTaskId===item.id ? dragOffsetY : 0}}px)" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtouchstart="onTaskTouchStart" bindtouchmove="onTaskTouchMove" bindtouchend="onTaskTouchEnd" bindlongpress="onTaskLongPress"><view class="check" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="toggle"></view><view class="task-main"><view>{{item.pinned?'📌 ':''}}{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.subject}}</view></view><picker range="{{durationOptions}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="changeDuration"><view class="duration">{{item.minutes ? item.minutes + ' 分钟' : '设置时长'}}</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{activeTaskId===item.id}}" class="task-actions"><view class="action pin" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="togglePin">{{item.pinned?'取消置顶':'置顶'}}</view><view class="action category" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseCategory">分类</view><view class="action delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="confirmDelete">删除</view></view></view></block><view wx:if="{{completedTasks.length}}" class="completed-divider"><view class="divider-line"></view><view class="completed-label">已完成 {{completedTasks.length}} 项</view><view class="divider-line"></view></view><block wx:for="{{completedTasks}}" wx:key="id"><view class="task-wrap completed-wrap"><view class="card task" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtouchstart="onTaskTouchStart" bindtouchend="onTaskTouchEnd"><view class="check checked" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="toggle">✓</view><view class="task-main"><view class="done">{{item.pinned?'📌 ':''}}{{item.title}}</view><view class="muted">{{item.subject}}</view></view><picker range="{{durationOptions}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindchange="changeDuration"><view class="duration">{{item.minutes ? item.minutes + ' 分钟' : '设置时长'}}</view></picker></view><view wx:if="{{activeTaskId===item.id}}" class="task-actions"><view class="action pin" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="togglePin">{{item.pinned?'取消置顶':'置顶'}}</view><view class="action category" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="chooseCategory">分类</view><view class="action delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="confirmDelete">删除</view></view></view></block><view class="card daily-loop"><view class="loop-title">{{reviewCoach.title || '今日收尾'}}</view><view class="coach-message">{{reviewCoach.message}}</view><view class="loop-grid"><view class="loop-metric"><view class="loop-value">{{completed}}/{{total}}</view><view class="loop-label">任务完成</view></view><view class="loop-metric"><view class="loop-value">{{focusMinutes}}/{{goalMinutes}}</view><view class="loop-label">专注分钟</view></view><view class="loop-metric"><view class="loop-value">{{dueReviewCount}}</view><view class="loop-label">待复习</view></view></view><view class="loop-actions"><button wx:if="{{dueReviewCount}}" size="mini" class="loop-review" bindtap="goReview">去复盘</button><button size="mini" bindtap="copyDailySummary">复制今日总结</button></view></view><view class="swipe-tip">向左滑动任务卡，可置顶、分类或删除</view><view class="card add"><input value="{{newTask}}" placeholder="添加今天的新任务" bindinput="setNewTask" bindconfirm="addTask"/><button size="mini" bindtap="addTask">添加</button></view></view>
